み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゾウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つく.る・つく.り・-づく.り</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">製造</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいぞう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">制造；生产</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">改造</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいぞう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">改造；改建；重建；改装；改良；改组；重组；（游戏、硬件等的）模改；改装</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">構造</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうぞう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">结构；构造；组成；框架；体系；样式</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">被</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>蒙受；覆盖；穿戴；承担；遭受</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヒ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">こうむ.る・おお.う・かぶ.る・かぶ.せる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">被る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かぶる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">戴（在头上）；戴着；从头上套下；蒙住头；自行加冕；蒙上（灰尘、雪等）；被覆盖；往自己身上浇（水等）；淋；（船）上浪进水；承担；承受；负责；肩负；重叠；交叠；相似；重复；冗余；（胶片因曝光过度等）起雾；发灰；（戏剧等）收场；落幕；停演；（戏剧等）满座；客满；票售罄；（戏剧等）演砸；失手；失败；被欺骗；上当</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">被害</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひがい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">损害；伤害；受害</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">被せる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かぶせる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">覆盖；盖住；戴在；套在；倒液体；泼液体；镀；镶牙冠；配音；加入；打断说话；归咎；推卸责任</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">技</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>技能；技艺；技巧；本领；手艺</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ギ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><s